{"ASK_SCARED","role=family_man|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Yeah, but they look at me like I'll know what to do, so... I try not to show it"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=family_woman|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Yes, I can keep busy and not think about it, mostly"},false,false,{[1]={{t="Then I stop, and... yeah",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=family_elder|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Of course I am, getting old didn't take care of that"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=family_youth|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"I thought the grown-ups knew what to do - you're all just guessing too, aren't you?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=civilian_man|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"I jump at every little noise - try to laugh it off, but... God, it's embarrassing"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=civilian_woman|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Sometimes I'm alright, then I see something move and my stomach just drops"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=elite_operator|st=neutral,careful",{"I'm not gonna put on a show for you"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=elite_delta|st=neutral,careful",{"That's not something you need to assess"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=mercenary|st=neutral,careful",{"People who pay you and think they bought you, I don't like those people"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Don't care for surprises, you don't have to hear about it every time"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=raider|st=careful,hostile",{"You trying to find out? Don't"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=raider_boss|st=careful,hostile",{"You want me to prove something to you? Get over yourself"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=law_sheriff|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"The badge doesn't mean I know everything, worries me when people think it does - officers too"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=law_officer|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Yeah, I'm scared"},false,false,{[1]={{t="I'm trying not to let it make decisions for me - some days that's harder",afterMs=1800}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=law_sergeant|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"You can be scared and still do your job, I'm not gonna chew anybody out for shaking"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=law_trooper|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Been caught off guard plenty of times, feeling calm doesn't mean much by itself"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=law_corrections|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"I like knowing what happens next - lost that - don't like it one bit"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=swat_lead|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"I'm concerned about mistakes we can prevent, so we check things - then check again"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=swat_operator|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"I'm paying attention, I don't need to get loud about it"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=soldier|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Yeah, I just keep doing whatever needs doing next"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=soldier_nco|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Don't have to feel brave, have to be careful"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=soldier_green|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"YES, sorry - yeah, they give you the gear, they don't turn off your stomach"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=deserter|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Sometimes I think I hear somebody I know calling me - that scares me more than you'd think"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=militia|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"I talked a lot about being ready, not much to say now I'm actually here"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=civilian_loner|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Yeah, I don't like people right up on me"},false,false,{[1]={{t="Not saying you're doing anything, just give me a little room",afterMs=2500}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=worker|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Scared I'll get tired and do something stupid, seen a man lose fingers like that"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Training gets my feet moving... I'm still scared under it, yeah"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Yes, I've seen enough go wrong to be scared - can we leave it there?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"I pray, and my hands still shake, both things happen"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=law_deputy|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"I worry I'll make a bad call and someone'll get hurt - that's the bit that stays with me"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=gang_member|st=careful,hostile",{"Worry about yourself, I'm watching you just fine"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=gang_boss|st=neutral,careful,hostile",{"I get nervous - don't mean I have to announce it"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=biker|st=neutral,careful",{"Yeah, around people I don't know, met too many assholes not to be"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=biker_boss|st=neutral,careful",{"Of a guy doing something stupid to show he's loyal"},false,false,{[1]={{t="Seen people get hurt over that, wish he'd just stayed home",afterMs=2500}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=crime_member|st=neutral,careful",{"I'm paying attention - call it what you like"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=prisoner|st=neutral,careful",{"Scared? Spent enough time locked up to get used to scared - doesn't mean I like it"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,5",{"Everyone's scared, the ones who aren't are lying or already gone, fear keeps you careful","Hell yeah I'm scared, I pinned the badge on anyway"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=civilian|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hell yes I'm scared, anybody says they ain't is a liar"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=family|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'm terrified, but if I show it, so will the children"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"Yeah, but I get to work and the fear goes quiet for a while","Scared of heights my whole life, and I've been sleeping on the water tower for a week - so, yeah - some"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"I pray when I'm scared, it doesn't always help, but it's something","I don't get to be scared on shift, I'll be scared later, when I have a minute to sit down"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral",{"Of course, fear keeps you careful"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Scared? Sure, it tells me where the danger is"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=military|st=friendly,neutral",{"Afraid? Soldiers don't talk about that"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Not anymore","No"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=outlaw|st=friendly,neutral",{"I was scared once, got over it"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=raider|st=friendly,neutral",{"You think I'm afraid? Funny"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=gang|st=friendly,neutral",{"Nobody on my block gets scared, we just get angry"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=club|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"Never been afraid of the road, everything else, maybe"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"I can't afford being scared, so I'm not"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Scared all the time, it's what keeps me alive"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Scared? SCARED? I'm terrified, I'm shaking, can't you see me shaking?!","Every second, every single second, my heart's been in my throat since Friday","Course I'm scared -- aren't you? You say no, you're lying or crazy","Yeah... yes, I am, sorry, I keep trying to be brave and it keeps slipping","I'm so scared I can't think straight... I can't eat, I can't sleep, I can't cry anymore","Not of them, not exactly, I'm scared of being alone with them, you know?","Terrified, and I keep thinking, it can't get worse, and then it does","Scared?! SCARED?! I'm so scared I peed a little- ...sorry... TMI","Yes!! yes yes yes yes YES, aren't you?!","I'm terrified, I'm TERRIFIED, I'm shaking like a leaf, look at my hands!"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Scared is a luxury, I'm too tired to be scared","Used to be, then it wore off, now I just feel careful, and a little numb","Sure, but fear keeps you sharp, I've learned to use it","A little, always a little, it's what keeps me alive","Of the dead? no, of the living? yes, definitely, the living worry me more","Hell yes","Damn right I am"},false,false,{[6]={{t="only an idiot isn't",afterMs=2200}},[7]={{t="it keeps me sharp",afterMs=2500}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Why? do I look scared? stay back","No, I'm not scared of anything, certainly not you","I'm NOT afraid of anything, certainly not you!","Don't ask me that","Of you?","Not of anything I can't handle","Why? are you planning something?!","No, I'm NOT, and don't you dare say otherwise","Scared of you, maybe - don't come any closer"},false,false,{[5]={{t="should I be?",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"Yes, and I don't hide it from my patients, it helps them be honest with me..","Terrified, but trained to look calm, it's a skill, and it's a curse","Yes, and I tell my patients so, because pretending makes it worse","Scared and exhausted, and still working, that's what nursing is"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"Of course, and I'm a man of faith, so imagine how everyone else feels","I would be lying if I said no"},false,false,{[2]={{t="a priest who isn't afraid is a priest who isn't paying attention",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral",{"Scared? yeah, always, every call, it never goes away, you learn to carry it","Every call","Scared? Yeah"},false,false,{[2]={{t="you learn to carry it",afterMs=3500}},[3]={{t="scared keeps you alive in a burning building",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=militia|st=friendly,neutral",{"Fear's part of the job, you just keep it in your pocket and keep moving","Fear keeps you sharp","Everybody is..."},false,false,{[2]={{t="I let it ride along, long as it doesn't drive",afterMs=3500}},[3]={{t="you just move anyway, that's all",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=rescue_medical|st=careful",{"I can't afford to look scared in front of strangers"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Scared? Every minute","Of course I'm scared","I get scared at night, mostly","Terrified","I'm scared of the quiet","Yes","The scariest thing isn't them","I shake","Scared for my kids -- scared for my wife, scared for my dog","I don't say it out loud","Always, always","Wouldn't you be?"},false,false,{[1]={{t="I've learned to walk with it, like a limp",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="scared keeps me alive",afterMs=3200},{t="scared and a good pair of boots",afterMs=2800}},[3]={{t="when the house settles",afterMs=3500},{t="and I think it's something else",afterMs=3000}},[4]={{t="and I know you can see it, so, why pretend?",afterMs=3200}},[5]={{t="the dead are loud, but the quiet is worse",afterMs=3500}},[6]={{t="but I'm more scared of being alone than of them",afterMs=3000}},[7]={{t="it's the moment you realize you're getting used to them",afterMs=3500}},[8]={{t="it's nothing",afterMs=3200},{t="it just comes and goes like a cough",afterMs=2800}},[9]={{t="and scared a little for myself, which is new",afterMs=3500}},[10]={{t="but I check the locks four times",afterMs=3200}},[11]={{t="the trick is to keep walking while you're at it",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=funny",{"Scared? Me? Never!","I'm so scared I've started talking to the furniture"},false,false,{[1]={{t="...okay, a little, okay, a lot",afterMs=2800}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"A bit, but you make it better"},false,false,{[1]={{t="I mean that",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=civilian_loner|st=friendly,neutral",{"Scared? Sure","I get nervous before a storm","Respect, mostly"},false,false,{[1]={{t="a man who's not scared is a fool or a liar",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="this is a bigger storm",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="fear and respect look alike from the outside",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=civilian_loner|st=careful",{"Not of you"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=family_elder|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'm too old to be scared, dear","My heart says yes","Of course I am"},false,false,{[1]={{t="...well, I'm scared, I'm just too tired to show it",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="my knees say \"who cares\"",afterMs=3200},{t="my head says \"pray\"",afterMs=2800}},[3]={{t="I'm scared all day long",afterMs=3500},{t="it's mostly for the people I love",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=family_youth|st=friendly,neutral",{"Yeah, obviously","I pretend I'm not.."},false,false,{[1]={{t="don't tell my friends",afterMs=3200}},[2]={{t="it helps a little",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"Scared of a lot of things","Sure"},false,false,{[1]={{t="a collapsing roof, a gas leak, a lost finger",afterMs=3500},{t="this is just another thing",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="fear keeps your hands careful",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=worker|st=careful",{"Scared? Of you?"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=family_man,family_woman|st=friendly,neutral",{"Every second, for them"},false,false,{[1]={{t="not for me",afterMs=3500},{t="I stopped being scared for myself a week ago",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=family_man,family_woman|st=careful",{"For my family, yes"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=rescue_clergy|st=careful",{"Do not ask me that"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=rescue_firefighter|st=careful",{"Scared of nothing"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3",{"Terrified, it's all so new, I keep expecting to wake up","Yeah, I haven't stopped shaking since Friday"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=4,14",{"I'm getting used to it, which scares me more","A little less each day"},false,false,{[2]={{t="and that scares me",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=15,99999",{"Not like I was","I've lost the ability to be surprised.."},false,false,{[1]={{t="fear changes shape",afterMs=3500},{t="now it's mostly dread",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=22,4",{"It's the night","More than in the day","I keep seeing things"},false,false,{[1]={{t="every sound is a footstep",afterMs=3500},{t="every shadow is a shape",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="the dark makes everything bigger",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="at the edge of the light",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=5,10",{"Less now, in daylight"},false,false,{[1]={{t="the sun makes me brave, for a few hours",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=11,18",{"In the sun, a little less"},false,false,{[1]={{t="but they're still out there",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=19,21",{"The closer it gets to dark, the worse it is"},false,false,{[1]={{t="my stomach knots",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Scared? Me? Hah! ...no, no, I'm not scared, I just don't sleep much, that's different","Scared of what, the dead? They're slow, I'm not scared of slow, it's the quiet ones I don't like","I'm not scared, I'm careful, there's a difference and it's kept me alive","You think anybody who says \"I'm not scared\" is telling the truth right now? Look at my hands","Scared is for people with something left to lose, and I lost it all a week ago","Scared? I'm TERRIFIED, okay? Happy now? Everybody is, only the stupid ones won't say it"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Scared of YOU? You've got to be joking!","Say that again and I'll show you what scared looks like, from the outside!"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"God... yeah, I am, I'm so scared I can barely breathe sometimes, I just never say it","Don't tell the others, but I cried in a closet for an hour yesterday, so yeah, I'm scared"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Scared? Nah... nah, I ain't scared of nothing... ...okay, that was a lie","I don't scare, {g:man|lady}, I watch my people, that's what keeps me busy","Everybody scared, I just do it quiet so my boys don't see","Scared? I lost my little brother on day one, there's nothing left to be scared of, just numb"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Don't start worrying about me. You and I aren't friends"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Yeah... yeah, I am, my hands won't stop shaking, I'm not gonna lie to you"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Scared? Kid, I've done two tours and buried three friends, I don't scare, I just sleep with a pistol under my pillow","Being the only one left... that's the part I can't get past","Fear's for the young and the stupid, I'm neither... mostly","Honestly? Every night, like clockwork, three a.m., eyes wide open... but I'd never say it in front of the club"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Scared of you? You're about as frightening as a wet kitten"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=club|st=friendly",{"All the time, {g:brother|sister}, all the damn time, it doesn't stop, you just learn to walk through it"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Fear is information, and I make use of it, but I am not governed by it","I don't deal in fear, I deal in consequences, there is a difference","An odd question, but yes, in the quiet moments, everyone is afraid"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"I confess, yes, more than I let on, and more with each passing day"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Scared? I-- yes, yes I'm scared, I'm scared all the time, every noise, every shadow, every breath","Yeah, but not of the dead, I'm scared of going back inside, that's worse, that's way worse","Don't look at me like that, I know I'm shaking, I can't help it","Scared? I haven't been anything else since I was nineteen"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Don't you laugh at me! DON'T LAUGH!"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"Yes, God, yes... nobody asks me that, it helps just saying it out loud"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Scared? Course I am, anybody who isn't is dead or about to be","Fear keeps me sharp, so I keep a little handy, like a good knife","Not scared, exactly, just... tired of being scared, if that makes any sense"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"Yeah, I'm scared, friend, I'm scared as hell, glad I'm not alone out here"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=deserter|st=neutral,careful",{"I'm terrified, I ran because I was terrified, that's the truth, and I'll live with it"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Every cop is afraid, the good ones just don't let it slow them down","I'm scared, yes, but I've got a badge and a duty, and that's what carries me","Yes. Being scared doesn't get me out of this","I was afraid of a lot of things as a kid, I never thought it would come to this"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=law|st=hostile",{"My feelings are not your concern, answer my questions"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=law|st=friendly",{"Yeah... I won't lie, I'm terrified, but talking about it helps"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral,careful",{"I've been scared since Friday, {g:son|young lady}, only the dead stop being scared"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Fear is natural, what matters is what you do with it","Scared? Yes, but I follow orders and I do my job","We're all scared, soldier or not, that's just honest"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=military|st=hostile",{"Fear's not on my schedule, back off"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=military|st=friendly",{"Terrified, honestly, I try not to show it, but it's there"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"Yes! Oh God, yes, I'm so scared, I want my mom, is that stupid? I want my mom","I'm-- I'm trying not to be, but my knees keep shaking, you can see it, can't you?"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Scared for my kids, yes, scared for myself, no, that's a different thing","You don't farm in Kentucky without learning to hold fear in one hand and a shovel in the other"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=militia|st=friendly",{"Every single night, neighbor, and we pray together to hold it off"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","tmp=fresh|world=door",{"Yeah, I check a doorway, look away, then-- gotta check it again - every time"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","tmp=fresh",{"What if I know one of them? Like, I see their face and go to say hello before I--... Jesus","I keep feeling my arms - you'd KNOW if you got bit, right? You would?","Yes! And don't do the 'don't be scared' thing - just... tell me what to do","Somebody says hello and my mouth just dries up, can't even say it back sometimes","Nah, I'm-- yeah, yeah, I am - was that convincing for even a second?","Every time I hear teeth click I feel it in my whole back","Everybody keeps telling me to be brave, I don't wanna be brave, I wanna go home","When I get scared I can't get a word out - so if I go quiet, don't just... leave, okay?","I thought I'd scream, if it got bad, I mean - instead I just stood there with my mouth open","I'm scared I'll call somebody's name and they'll turn around and... you know - not be them anymore","I forgot so much stuff - keep thinking, I'll grab it when I get--... never mind","A bite scares me, but somebody I love getting bitten scares me worse"},false,{[2]="GENERIC",[5]="GENERIC",[8]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","tmp=fresh|day=0,7",{"Last week I was scared of being late for work","Sometimes I shut my eyes and think, okay, when I open them it'll be--... I know - I KNOW"},false,false,{[1]={{t="I'd take the whole damn shift now - overtime, whatever, just let me go to work",afterMs=2500}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","tmp=fresh|world=building",{"I can't put my back against something without checking behind it - even a wall, it's a fucking wall"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","tmp=fresh|st=friendly",{"Could you stay a bit?"},false,false,{[1]={{t="You don't have to - I just... I don't wanna be on my own right now",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Yeah, sorry I keep snapping at you, I'm not mad at you, I'm just... yeah","Yeah, I'm scared - doesn't mean I'm no use to you, all right?"},false,{[2]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=family_man,family_woman",{"I keep thinking I should call an adult"},false,false,{[1]={{t="I'm forty-three - that's me, I'm the fucking adult",afterMs=2500}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","st=friendly,neutral",{"I can be scared for a minute, but it's all day, then all night - can't get a break from it","That I'll get used to something I should never get used to","Making a decision for somebody who didn't get a say","Being so relieved somebody helped me that I stop asking questions","That I'll hear someone asking for help and decide it's easier not to hear","I don't know how to make that answer small enough for a casual conversation","That being frightened will make me cruel. I'm trying to catch it early"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=family_elder",{"Course I am - you want me to lie to you? I've lived a long time - nothing like this"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","tmp=seasoned,veteran",{"Yeah, you can't hear it, that's all - took practice","Sure, it's the ones telling me they're NOT scared I worry about","Yes, it usually catches up when I finally sit down","I don't talk much when it's bad, people mistake that for confidence"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=worker,military,rescue",{"Give me something to do, I'm fine, it's when I stop that it gets bad"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=law,military,swat",{"Of course - training helps, doesn't switch it off"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","tmp=veteran",{"Some, still getting the job done"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=soldier_nco,swat_lead,law_sergeant",{"Yes, I'm keeping it to myself, they've got enough going on"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","role=biker_boss,gang_boss,raider_boss",{"You want honesty or the answer I give the others?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=prison,outlaw,crime",{"I don't enjoy wondering who's awake when I shut my eyes"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=outlaw,club,prison",{"Yeah, being unpleasant hasn't made me bite-proof"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","st=careful,hostile",{"Scared doesn't mean I'll let you push me around","Why do you need to know? Leave it alone"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","st=careful",{"Enough that you shouldn't surprise me from behind","I'd rather not hand you something you could use against me"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","st=neutral,careful",{"More than I want you to know, probably","Being certain about the wrong person"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","st=friendly,neutral|day=14,3650",{"Less than I was... dunno if that's good, stuff that should bother me just doesn't"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","st=friendly,neutral|day=31,3650",{"Forgot about home for most of yesterday, wasn't even thinking about it","Yeah, don't ask me every morning, though, answer's gonna be the same"},false,false,{[1]={{t="That scared me worse than anything else yesterday",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_SCARED","st=friendly",{"You want the honest one? Being alone with no one left to miss me"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Plenty. I don't need to name every one to keep going"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Every second, my hands haven't stopped shaking since Friday - look - see? Still going","Yes, is that bad? My dad always said being scared just means you're paying attention","Yes. The dark didn't bother me before. Now I can't stand not being able to see","Not as scared as I was on the first day - I don't know if that's good or if something in me broke"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|hour=4,11",{"So scared I can't eat, I had half a cracker this morning and it came right back up"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Scared keeps you alive, it's when you quit being scared you get sloppy - watched it happen to my brother-in-law","Only at night, daytime I'm too busy, night's when you've got time to think"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=hostile",{"You'd like that, huh? I'm not scared of you - back off"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=rescue|role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral",{"Firemen are always scared, we just walk in anyway - only now the fire walks back out at you"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Anybody who says they're not is lying or a fool - I try hard to be neither","Yes. I'm scared there'll be more of them than we can stop"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=law,swat|st=careful,hostile",{"What I'm scared of is you doing something stupid - don't"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=military|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Yes, I'm not supposed to say so - please don't tell the sergeant I said so"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=military,elite|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'm scared too, I just don't let it drive","Scared was the first week, now it's just work"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=military,elite|st=careful,hostile",{"Wrong question, the right one is whether you want to be standing here when I get nervous"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=outlaw,crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"Scared? Hell yes, that's why there's a shotgun under the seat and three ways out of every room I sleep in","Only thing I was ever scared of was the law - look how that turned out"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=raider,gang,club,prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Scared? Hahaha, I'm having the time of my life, {g:man|lady}","Fear's for people with something to lose, I lost mine years before any of this"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful",{"Why, you want me to be? You're doing a poor job of it"}},
{"ASK_SCARED","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=hostile",{"The only one scared here is gonna be you, in about five seconds"}},
{"ASK_SEASON","",{"It's a season, they keep coming","Can't complain, can't plan, either","Time of year? Doesn't matter much anymore"}},
{"ASK_SEASON","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"It's a good season for survival, if you ask me","I like it"},false,false,{[1]={{t="warm, long days..",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="I wish I could enjoy it",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_SEASON","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"It's a season"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Sing? Me? No, no, I can't, I'm terrible, you'd run away","Maybe a lullaby, a quiet one, I used to sing to the baby, before","I sing in the shower, but there's no shower, so, no","A little hum, a little tune, just for me, just for now","Haha, you want me to sing? alright, but only one verse, and don't laugh...","I'd sing, but I'd attract them, and neither of us wants that","My voice is gone, from screaming, from crying, from nothing","\"Amazing Grace,\" that's my only song, and I only know the first verse","Sing? Oh, I'm awful, I'm so off-key, but okay, la la, hm hm hmmm","I haven't sung since... since before, hold on, let me clear my throat, ahem","My mother used to sing this while she did dishes, la da da, I don't know the words","I'll hum, I'll just hum, I can't sing out loud anymore, someone might hear","Sure, if you do the chorus with me, ready? One, two, three"},false,false,{[9]={{t="that's all I remember, sorry",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"No singing, they'll hear you","Are you out of your mind? no","Sing? Do I look like a jukebox? Stay back"}},
{"ASK_SING","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'll sing with you, softly, a hymn, for the dead, and for the living"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Sing? You want me to sing? I'd rather eat a boot","I don't sing, I hum when I'm nervous, and right now I'm not nervous, ask me again later","Hell no, the only thing I sing is at funerals, and that's mostly screaming","You first, hero, you sing, I'll hold the gun and applaud"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Sing?! I'll sing you a lullaby with this bullet!"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Ha, I can't sing for shit, but my mama had the sweetest voice, I'd hum her old hymns, if you want"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Sing? Nah, that's for church, and we don't go to church","I can't sing, but I can rap, you want to hear a rap?","Ask my little sister, she's the singer in the family, hope she's okay"},false,false,{[2]={{t="...no, no, I changed my mind, it's not very good",afterMs=2400}}}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Alright, I'll hum you something, my grandmother's favorite"},false,false,{[1]={{t="...mm mm mm... that's all I remember, my voice cracks every time",afterMs=2600}}}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"{g:Brother|Sister}, we don't sing, we roar, and right now I'm out of roar","I'll hum a few bars if you buy me a beer, but I'm out of beer so no deal","We sing at rallies, around a fire, drunk off our asses, I miss that so much"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"I do not sing in front of strangers","I have a fine baritone, but this is not the occasion"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"I used to sing in a church choir as a boy, perhaps a verse, softly"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Sing? In here? In THIS place? I can't, someone will hear, someone always hears","I used to sing in the shower, then the shower got taken away"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Sing? Ask me again and see what happens!"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"I'll hum, if it helps you relax, hum, hum, hmm... is that okay?"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Out here, the only singing is the birds, and I let them do the work","I sing to my horse, when nobody's listening, it keeps her calm"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"I know an old mountain song my granddad taught me, I'll hum the tune"},false,false,{[1]={{t="...it doesn't sound the same without his banjo",afterMs=2600}}}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"I'm on duty, I can't sing, it would be unprofessional","I sing in the shower, and only the shower"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=law|st=friendly",{"Alright, one verse, if it helps,"},false,false,{[1]={{t="...no, I can't, sorry, my voice is shot from shouting",afterMs=2400}}}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"We sing cadence while running, but I'm not running, and this isn't a parade","I don't sing, soldier, I count steps"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=military|st=friendly",{"Alright, civilian, a cadence, but you join in"},false,false,{[1]={{t="...sound off, one two, sound off, three four, that's all I've got",afterMs=2600}}}},
{"ASK_SING","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"We sing hymns on Sundays, and I'm not about to belt one for a stranger","My wife has the voice, I just mouth the words"}},
{"ASK_SING","role=militia|st=friendly",{"Come to our service, friend, you'll hear singing that'd make angels weep"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Sing?! In front of you?! No no no no, I'd die of embarrassment, okay, maybe a verse","Oh God, okay, but nobody laugh, nobody laugh at all"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral",{"Sing? Are you insane? They'll hear us","Not a chance, quiet, you idiot"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=family|st=friendly,neutral",{"Dear, I do know a lullaby, come sit, hush, hush, hush","I'll hum an old hymn, it always calms the children, come closer"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'm no singer, but I'll try the national anthem, no, wait, that's too loud","Sing? Haha, no, but I'll whistle, how about that?","Department Christmas party karaoke, 1991, I did one song, nobody's let me forget it, and I'm not doing it again","Not out here - Singing's noise, and noise brings company"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=military,elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Negative on singing, noise discipline","Cadence call, maybe, quietly, hup, two, three"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Sing? Hahaha, sure, I know a dirty one about a sailor","Let me find my bottle first, then I'll croon"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful,hostile",{"You want a song? Here's one: shut up"}},
{"ASK_SING","tmp=veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Sing? Ha, no, not even in the shower"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Sing? Out here? They'd hear me clear up in Louisville - no, thank you","Mm-hmm-hmm, hmm-hmm, that's all you get, I sang in the choir at First Baptist, but that's all you get","I can hum a little - hmm-hmm-hmmm, okay, stop looking at me, I'm embarrassed"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=civilian,family|role=family_man,family_woman,civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"My daughter made me sing her to sleep every night - I can't - I'm sorry, I can't do that one anymore"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Only song I know by heart is the one they sing at funerals - and I'm done singing that one","My singing would scare off the dead, might be worth a try, actually - no - no"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=hostile",{"The only music out here's gonna be gunfire if you don't leave"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=rescue|role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"Sang bass in a gospel quartet thirty years - you want the bass part alone? It's just, bum - bum, bum"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=rescue|role=rescue_firefighter,rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"Only thing I sing is the siren - Wooo-ooo - there, that's my whole range"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"Guys at the shop sang along with the radio all day - terrible, every one of 'em, I miss it something awful"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=law,swat|st=careful,hostile",{"Not a chance - stay where you are"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=military|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"We sing cadence when we run, want me to, no, no, bad idea, they'd hear it - sorry"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=military,elite|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"I don't sing, I hum when I clean my rifle, you're not getting that either"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Negative"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=military,elite|st=careful,hostile",{"This is a checkpoint, not a talent show"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=outlaw,crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"Played guitar in a bar band in Brandenburg, pawned it for bail money, never did get it back out","Sing? Buy me a drink and wait till last call - oh, wait, last call was two weeks ago"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=raider,gang,club|st=friendly,neutral",{"You want me to sing? Hahaha, you dance for me first - go on, dance"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=prison|st=friendly,neutral|world=door",{"Only tune I know is the buzzer when the cell doors open - real catchy"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful",{"Not singing for strangers, not talking much to 'em either"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=hostile",{"Sing? How about I make you scream instead"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Sing? Out here? You want everything in the county coming to the show?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=family|st=friendly,neutral|world=building",{"I hum to the baby, that's all the singing getting done in this house"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral|world=vehicle,window",{"I sing in the truck with the windows up, that's a private matter"}},
{"ASK_SING","role=rescue_medical|st=neutral,friendly",{"Sang in a choir till I was twenty, can't get eight bars in now without stopping"}},
{"ASK_SING","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly|mood=sad",{"We quit singing, sound carries off that hill, that's the thing I miss the worst..."}},
{"ASK_SING","role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly|mood=funny",{"Fella at the station sings while he cooks - badly, we never once told him"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=civilian|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral,friendly",{"I know about four songs all the way through and three of 'em are church songs"}},
{"ASK_SING","role=family_elder|st=friendly|mood=warm",{"I'll sing you the one my mother sang over the wash - come sit down, then"}},
{"ASK_SING","role=law_deputy|st=neutral",{"Not on duty - ask me in eight years when this is done with"}},
{"ASK_SING","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=neutral|world=road",{"We had a cadence for road marches, it was filthy, I ain't doing it for you"}},
{"ASK_SING","role=soldier_green|tmp=fresh|st=neutral",{"I can do the anthem - that's it, that's my whole songbook right there"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=elite|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"No - gotta keep quiet - ask me something else"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=club|st=neutral|mood=funny",{"I sing at about seventy mile an hour where nobody can hear it - perfect pitch up there"}},
{"ASK_SING","role=crime_member|st=neutral",{"I'll sing for a can of peaches, two cans if you want it in tune"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=raider|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"You want a song? Here's one: everything you're carrying is about to be mine"}},
{"ASK_SING","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=careful|mood=sad",{"No, I tried humming the other night and I couldn't stop crying - so, no..."}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Sleep? what's sleep? I close my eyes and see them, so I don't close my eyes much","An hour HERE -- an hour there, I never really sleep, I just kind of fall over","In shifts, one sleeps while the other one stays up watching","I sleep with my shoes on, and my coat on, and my hand on the bat","I haven't slept properly since Friday -- I think my brain has started to hallucinate","W-when I can, where I can, in a closet, in a car, in a cupboard, anywhere with a lock"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Light sleep, one ear open, one hand on my weapon, that's how I live now","I sleep in the afternoon... when it's quietest, and I stay up at night, when it's loudest","Four hours a night if I'm lucky, and I jump at every noise","Different spot every night, never in the open, I'm not sleeping in the same place twice","Dreams are the worst part... I don't want to talk about my dreams.."}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"If you want to rest, rest, I'm a light sleeper anyway"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Why? you want to know when I'm vulnerable?","Where I sleep is my own damn business","Where I sleep isn't something I'll tell you - keep walking","Not anywhere near strangers, that's for sure"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","role=rescue_medical",{"Sleep, it's the best medicine and the cheapest, I prescribe it to everyone, then ignore it myself"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","role=rescue_clergy",{"I pray myself to sleep, and sometimes it works"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","role=rescue_firefighter",{"Firehouse habits die hard, I sleep in four-hour blocks, with boots by the bed"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","role=militia",{"Cat naps, fifteen minutes, twenty, whenever the watch allows"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=22,4",{"I should be sleeping, but I can't","Right now? I'm on watch","Sleep? In THIS?"},false,false,{[1]={{t="I lie there, listening",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="someone has to be",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="I close one eye at a time",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=5,10",{"I finally nodded off an hour ago","I sleep in the morning... after the watch.."},false,false,{[1]={{t="and then the birds started",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="the light helps",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=11,18",{"I nap in the afternoon, the quiet hours","Midday's my sleeping time"},false,false,{[1]={{t="before the evening starts",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="it's the safest",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=19,21",{"Soon... as soon as it's dark, I'll try","I'm getting ready for bed already"},false,false,{[1]={{t="not that it works",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="pillow, blanket, bat",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Sleep? What's that? I catch an hour here, an hour there, with one eye open","I sleep with my boots on and my gun in my hand, and I still wake up screaming","Sleep is for people who don't have enemies, which isn't me","Maybe three hours a night, tops, I dream about it, the sleep, I mean"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Sleep? I'll put you to sleep permanently!"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Honestly? I haven't slept right in days, I'd kill for a full night's rest","Every time I close my eyes I see them, so I try not to close them"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Sleep? In shifts, one up, the rest down","I crash when I can, wherever I can, don't matter","Haven't had a real bed since the block party, I miss my mattress"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"I sleep with my sister's rosary around my wrist, it helps, a little"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Sleep? A couple of hours on the ground, a rolled-up jacket for a pillow","We rotate watches, I take the third one, nobody likes the third one","Sleep is a luxury, {g:brother|sister}, I'll sleep when this is over"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=club|st=friendly",{"I dream about the open road, those are the good nights"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"I sleep lightly, always have, a habit of my profession","Lousy, same as always"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"I take a sip of brandy, it helps, a little"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"I don't sleep, I can't, if I close my eyes they might come","In the cell, I slept like a baby, now I can't, funny, huh?"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Don't ask me about sleep, I can't sleep!"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"Hardly at all, but when I do, I dream about my mother's kitchen"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"I sleep in the trees, off the ground, one ear open","A few hours at dawn, when it's quietest"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"With my dog beside me, when I had one, it was the best sleep"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"I sleep in my uniform, ready to jump up at a moment's notice","A few hours a night, if I'm lucky, it's not enough"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=law|st=friendly",{"I keep a photo of my family under my pillow, helps me drift off"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"We sleep in shifts, always one on watch","Four hours, in uniform, rifle at my side"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=military|st=friendly",{"I think of home before I sleep, it helps"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"I don't sleep, I can't, I just lie there, listening, terrified"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"We rotate watches, I get four hours, my wife gets four, the kids sleep in the middle","Sleep is hard-won, but we manage"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","role=militia|st=friendly",{"With a prayer, friend, and a rifle by the bed"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|sex=f",{"I don't, really, maybe two hours - my husband used to snore and I hated it, it's so quiet now"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|world=vehicle,door",{"We sleep in the car with the doors locked, the kids think it's fun - I don't sleep at all"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|world=building",{"In the closet, with the vacuum cleaner - isn't that silly? It's the only door that locks from the inside"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"I take turns with my sister, she watches, I sleep - she's twelve, she's very brave"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"In shifts, two on, four off, whoever sleeps on watch doesn't eat the next morning","Light, you stop sleeping deep the first week, your body figures it out for you","Afternoons, when the heat's worst and they're sluggish, nights I'm up, reading by a candle behind a blanket"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral|world=building",{"Upstairs, boots on, weapon by the pillow, you get used to the boots"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=hostile",{"Not while you're around - go"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"Worked graveyard shift for years, sleeping days comes easy, nights, I'm up"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=rescue|role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"Twenty minutes at a time - ER habit, you'd be amazed how long a person runs on twenty minutes"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=rescue|role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral|world=door",{"Station bunks, alarm's a cowbell on a string across the door now - it works fine"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=rescue|role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral|world=door",{"In the pew by the door, if somebody knocks, I want to be the first one to hear it"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral|world=vehicle,door",{"In the cruiser, doors locked, seat back, radio on low in case somebody calls a unit that's still around"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=law,swat|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral|world=building",{"Rarely, {sir}, when I do, it's with my back to a wall"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=law,swat|st=careful,hostile",{"I'm not discussing my security with you"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=military|st=friendly,neutral",{"In shifts, four hours if we're lucky - nobody's lucky"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=military|role=soldier,soldier_green|st=friendly,neutral|world=vehicle",{"We sleep in the truck bed under a tarp - Sergeant sleeps with his eyes open, I swear he does"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=elite",{"When the tasking allows - not long"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=military|st=careful,hostile",{"None of your concern, move along"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=outlaw,raider,crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"Sleep like a baby, nothing to feel guilty about - heh"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Six years on a steel bunk with two hundred men yelling - a barn's a hotel"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=gang|st=friendly,neutral",{"We take turns, somebody's always up with a gun in his lap - rule one"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=club|st=friendly,neutral",{"On the pool table at the clubhouse, best bed I ever had, honest"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=hostile|hour=16,5",{"Real sound, better than you're gonna sleep tonight"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful,hostile",{"Why, you planning on visiting while I'm out? Try it"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Two hours, maybe, I wake up when the house settles, every time it settles"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=family|st=neutral,friendly",{"We take turns, my wife sleeps first, 'cause she's the one thinking straight"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral|world=vehicle",{"I sleep in the truck with the seat back, been doing it on job sites since '86"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","role=rescue_medical|st=neutral|mood=funny",{"Twenty minutes at a time, that ain't sleep, that's fainting on a schedule"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","role=rescue_clergy|st=neutral|mood=grim",{"I sleep fine, that bothers me a good deal more than not sleeping would"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","reg=civilian|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral|world=building",{"Four hours, boots on, back to a wall, you'll get used to it and you'll hate that"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","role=law_deputy|st=neutral|world=vehicle,door,window",{"In the car, doors locked, window cracked an inch so I can hear"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Four on, eight off, if there's enough of you, there's never enough of you"}},
{"ASK_SLEEP","role=elite_delta|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"I sleep where I can see the way I came in - never where I ate - never twice"}},
